2026-10-28 the author: boxedPINE's proofs/ (github omi-axioms) and types/ (github omi-types) are submodules, on main; the author asked Claude to manage them. A change is committed and pushed inside the submodule first, then its commit recorded in boxedPINE (git add types). AGENTS.md says how.

